{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent alone is not enough to become a powerful cultivator. You'll need legendary artifacts, mystical abilities, powerful techniques, loyal spirit pets, and a touch of fate. Only by joining a mighty sect and becoming a true disciple can you begin to ascend the path to immortality!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/e532f8ded97e9c1646b45d5550beddfa.avif?t=1756691910\" data-has-big width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper Realm: Path of the Immortal</strong> is a Roguelike survival strategy game set in a world of Eastern cultivation. classic roguelite growth systems, it combines thrilling gameplay with a unique paper-sculpted visual style. Characters and environments appear like 3D paper carvings, brought to life with shifting light and shadow to create a serene yet mystical fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a cultivator striving to survive wave after wave of incoming beasts. Master divine arts, refine artifacts, practice powerful techniques, join sects, trigger random events, and tame spirit beasts \u2014 all in the name of survival and ascension!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/61d4e6883e53c0d69ad156e7bfbdf229.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/fae591965b064b7a15dd703c329d4acd.poster.avif?t=1756691910\" width=820 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/fae591965b064b7a15dd703c329d4acd.webm?t=1756691910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f</strong>Got some downtime at work? Pop the game into windowed mode\u2014one hand on your character, the other pretending to browse. Work and play, all in balance. Or after a long day, kick back with a cup of coffee and dive in. No tricky controls, just easy one-handed fun you can enjoy with friends or that special someone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/356fa0b93873b81ec86cef11d49e2aca.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/f45f32cb00580942449dc127062d0fcd.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1560 height=971 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f</strong>Level up as you fight and gain EXP! In the world of cultivation, your journey goes through stages like <strong>Qi Refining</strong>, <strong>Foundation Building</strong>, <strong>Core Formation</strong>, <strong>Nascent Soul</strong>, and even higher realms. Each stage is split into early, mid, and late phases. Advancing a minor stage boosts your stats, while breaking through to a major stage lets you unlock new abilities in the talent tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/8090d3e6b69f39a41136f71311affda5.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/b93ebdaaa27b620d520d7ca4082ebbd7.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=397 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0cetween each enemy wave, you\u2019ll enter the \u2018<strong>Rest Realm</strong>.\u2019 Take a breather, but don\u2019t forget to spend your Spirit Essence to study new spells, forge powerful artifacts, master cultivation techniques, join sects, explore trials, or even tame spirit beasts\u2014everything you need to prepare for the next monster onslaught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/a1e9d76c9c55895b32a4a2849dc1fe89.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/15d809b03a5c6db2b43d65a4ea2fdd09.avif?t=1756691910\" width=820 height=298 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfef</strong>Join the sect you like and grow stronger with its unique resources. Choose and master a cultivation technique to shape your own path and define a style that\u2019s truly yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/88afed129e3b67c35e479a61b55733b9.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/3eff5309ee25d72b13d30a4a9401e983.poster.avif?t=1756691910\" width=820 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/3eff5309ee25d72b13d30a4a9401e983.webm?t=1756691910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fMerge and upgrade your treasures to forge the ultimate artifact! Your spirit pets can not only evolve into higher forms, but also fuse with others to unleash entirely new powers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/01afe88774e8100689d26d01be100eda.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/4cdaa23f2aaba986c2bfcfd1e386599b.poster.avif?t=1756691910\" width=820 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/4cdaa23f2aaba986c2bfcfd1e386599b.webm?t=1756691910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaeSpells and magical artifacts are the weapons of cultivators. A variety of carefully designed, uniquely styled abilities and artifacts are essential allies on your journey to immortality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/434ae9179183ea1a5efcdc2b7d23b328.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1474 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64Whether you like to charge in headfirst as a tank, take hits with your own body, snipe enemies from afar, crunch the numbers to generate endless resources, or stay put and dish out damage as a caster-tank\u2014there\u2019s a character for every playstyle! Even more unique and fun-to-play characters are coming soon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/3a90dbfabcff8bb4372d12b2082d39ac.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1406 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/12d7b9fc95d6299aeaaf136de98023b0.avif?t=1756691910\" width=1406 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddedA huge variety of items awaits you! Frequent updates keep new content flowing like a tidal wave, making sure the fun never stops!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Plans</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Least 20 New Characters Added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Fusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Spirit Pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More content and gameplay are on the way\u2014add us to your wishlist and stay tuned!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Journey Through the Paper Realm, Survive to Ascend\u2019 \u2014 In this paper-crafted world of cultivation, fend off waves of monsters and push your limits!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748740?t=1756691910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748740?t=1756691910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item